<mxfile host="drawio"><diagram id="03 Authenticated tool call" name="03 Authenticated tool call"><mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1990" pageHeight="940" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="After sign-in: one authenticated MCP request" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="640" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="Steps 1-6 run on every request. Steps 7-8 run only when Claude calls the telegram tool." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#4d4d4d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="650" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude" value="claude.ai" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=60;fontSize=15;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="220" height="790" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gate" value="Auth gate&#xa;POST /:botToken/mcp" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=60;fontSize=15;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="110" width="220" height="790" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="clerk" value="Clerk" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=60;fontSize=15;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="110" width="220" height="790" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="handler" value="MCP handler&#xa;+ telegram tool" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=60;fontSize=15;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="110" width="220" height="790" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tg" value="Telegram&#xa;Bot API" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=60;fontSize=15;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="110" width="220" height="790" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="1. POST + Bearer" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1a1a1a;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.1392;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.1392;" edge="1" parent="1" source="claude" target="gate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="2. read botToken" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1a1a1a;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.2152;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.2582;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gate" target="gate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="500" y="280"/><mxPoint x="500" y="314"/></Array><mxPoint x="71" y="24" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="3. verify token" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1a1a1a;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.3165;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.3165;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gate" target="clerk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="4. authenticated?" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#4d4d4d;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.3924;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.3924;" edge="1" parent="1" source="clerk" target="gate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="Not authenticated: 401 + WWW-Authenticate,&#xa;so Claude restarts the flow in 02." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=14;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="460" width="330" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="5. handler.fetch" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1a1a1a;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.5696;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.5696;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gate" target="handler"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="6. createServer" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1a1a1a;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.6456;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.6886;" edge="1" parent="1" source="handler" target="handler"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1100" y="620"/><mxPoint x="1100" y="654"/></Array><mxPoint x="67" y="24" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="7. sendMessage" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#1a1a1a;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.7468;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.7468;" edge="1" parent="1" source="handler" target="tg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="8. message_id" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#4d4d4d;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.8228;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.8228;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tg" target="handler"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="9. tool result" style="html=1;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=bottom;curved=0;rounded=0;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#4d4d4d;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.8987;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.8987;" edge="1" parent="1" source="handler" target="claude"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="What each step does" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=40;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="110" width="430" height="440" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Every MCP request (initialize, tools/list,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;tools/call) is a POST that carries the Clerk access&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;token.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Before routing, the Bun fetch wrapper rewrites the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;URL from X-Forwarded-Host/Proto. The bot token&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;comes from the URL path.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; clerkClient.authenticateRequest(req, {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;acceptsToken: 'oauth_token' }). JWT tokens are&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;checked against Clerk's signing keys (JWKS, fetched&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;once and cached).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; requestState.isAuthenticated decides whether to go&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; handler.fetch(req, { authInfo: { token: botToken }&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;}): the bot token rides in as authInfo.token.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; createMcpHandler calls createServer(botToken),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;which registers the telegram tool.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; Only for tools/call: sendTelegramMessage calls the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Bot API with that bot token.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt; Telegram returns the sent message (id, chat, date).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.&lt;/b&gt; The handler replies with text + structuredContent.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;initialize and tools/list reply here without steps&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;7-8." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="v13"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="430" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
